   "since": "2026-09-01",
   "unit": null,
   "value": "The Commission on Review of Overseas Military Facility Structure of the United States was established as an ad hoc independent presidential advisory Commission by the Act of November 22, 2003 (Pub. L. 108-32).\r\n\r\nAlso known as the Overseas Basing Commission (OSBC), the Commission was created to conduct a comprehensive study of matters relating to the military facility structure overseas.\r\n\r\nThe Commission was terminated in 2005.\r\n",
